scid (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Support for Sistemler CID V6 USB device (16d0:0787)
  * 4-line simultaneous monitoring with FSK demodulation
  * JSON output mode for easy integration
  * Unix domain socket for multiple consumers
  * systemd service for auto-start

